      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofucon.us/about-ucon/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "When the railroad shifted the regional hub elsewhere, Ucon remained a close‑knit, enduring community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
